<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF S.AFRICA BONDS LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NET BUYERS OF S.AFRICA BONDS LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers</p>
<p>of 282.79 million rand worth of South African bonds last week,</p>
<p>latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				  Week to Oct 25   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		     3,858.87     139,342.60</p>
<p>    - sales			   3,576.08     136,237.90</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)	 282.79	 3,104.70</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
